      "Language": "cze",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Opportunities to examine patients with spastic angina pectoris are at present, due to the inaccessibility of ergonovine, very limited. The authors demonstrate on a small group of patients the application of echocardiographic hyperventilation test for assessment of the diagnosis of spastic angina pectoris."},
